// Title: Remote Access Tool - Ammy Admin Agent Execution
// Sigma ID: 7da7809e-f3d5-47a3-9d5d-fc9d019caf14
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: @kostastsale
// Date: 2024-08-05 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution, persistence
// Tags: detection.threat-hunting
// Description: Detects the execution of the Ammy Admin RMM agent for remote management.
// False positives:
//   - Legitimate use of Ammy Admin RMM agent for remote management by admins.
// References:
//   - https://www.ammyy.com/en/admin_features.html
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules-threat-hunting/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_remote_access_tools_ammyy_admin_execution.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\rundll32.exe" and ProcessCommandLine contains "AMMYY\\aa_nts.dll\",run"
